IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0014.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY PEN0014C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 WS-PWV             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 PA-AMT             PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER
    DISPLAY "WS-PWV=" WS-PWV
    DISPLAY "PA-AMT=" PA-AMT
    STOP RUN.
FIRST-OFFENSE-WAIVER.
    IF FO-IND = 'Y'
        IF WS-TIER = 'G' OR WS-TIER = 'P'
            MOVE 'Y' TO WS-PWV
            MOVE 0 TO PA-AMT
        *> GRACE PERIOD WAIVER
        ELSE IF DL-DD <= 7
            MOVE 'Y' TO WS-PWV
            MOVE 0 TO PA-AMT
        END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
